---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Frequently Asked Questions about TrackAndLog.",
};
---
<Layout seo={seo} title="FAQ | TrackAndLog">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

      <h2>Is TrackAndLog really free?</h2>
      <p>Yes. We don't charge a subscription for basic metric logging. If you need enterprise data integration, we may offer paid tiers in the future.</p>

      <h2>Can I export my data?</h2>
      <p>Absolutely. We strongly believe you should own your data. You can export all logs to CSV with one click.</p>

      <h2>Do you have an iOS/Android app?</h2>
      <p>We are a Progressive Web App (PWA). You can save us to your home screen for a fast, app-like experience without going through the app stores.</p>

      <h2>How do I track custom metrics?</h2>
      <p>Just type a name and start logging numbers. We don't restrict what you can measure.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
